{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2021-11-18 10:20:00', 'title': 'CBRE ARRANGES EXPANSION LEASE FOR COUR PHARMACEUTICALS', 'text': "CHICAGO, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TO MEET THE INCREASING DEMAND FOR MEDICAL RESEARCH SPACE IN THE CHICAGOLAND AREA, CBRE IS EXPANDING A 14,000 SQ. FT LEASE TO EXPAND COUR PHARMACEUTICALS' LIFE SCIENCE AND EMERGENCY BIOTECHNOLOGY FOOTPRINT WITHIN THE ILLINOIS SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY PARK IN SKOKIE, ILL."}